1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:02,750
Rosa: The bridge is up. And it won't come
down.

2
00:00:03,070 --> 00:00:08,087
BUS-E: Ding dong! This is the Last Bus.
Part seven of ten: the drawbridge.

3
00:00:08,407 --> 00:00:11,236
Dante: There's always a hidden lever. Or a
ramp.

4
00:00:11,356 --> 00:00:12,613
Priya: It's a forty-meter gap.

5
00:00:12,733 --> 00:00:14,860
Dante: I've made longer jumps in games.

6
00:00:15,180 --> 00:00:20,092
Rosa: Control tower. Left side. Someone
climbs up and pulls the lever.

7
00:00:20,412 --> 00:00:21,647
Marcus: Why is everyone looking at me?

8
00:00:21,767 --> 00:00:22,674
Priya: Because you're brave.

9
00:00:22,794 --> 00:00:24,085
Marcus: I'm aggressively cautious.

10
00:00:24,205 --> 00:00:26,747
Priya: That's brave, with extra steps.

11
00:00:27,067 --> 00:00:28,430
Teddy: Take Gary. He's brave.

12
00:00:28,550 --> 00:00:29,787
Marcus: He's green plastic.

13
00:00:29,907 --> 00:00:30,989
Teddy: He's brave plastic.

14
00:00:31,309 --> 00:00:33,615
Rosa: Where's the... left. Left!

15
00:00:33,735 --> 00:00:34,414
Priya: Rosa?

16
00:00:34,534 --> 00:00:35,488
Rosa: Long night.

17
00:00:35,808 --> 00:00:38,727
Marcus: Aggressively cautious.
Aggressively cautious.

18
00:00:39,047 --> 00:00:42,820
Marcus: Okay, Gary. On three. One. Two...

19
00:00:42,940 --> 00:00:43,367
Marcus: Three!

20
00:00:47,087 --> 00:00:48,285
Marcus: Nope! Nope! Nope!

21
00:00:48,687 --> 00:00:50,466
Marcus: I'm okay! I have Gary!

22
00:00:50,586 --> 00:00:51,678
Teddy: Marcus is a hero!

23
00:00:51,998 --> 00:00:53,079
Steve: After you.

24
00:00:53,598 --> 00:00:56,344
Priya: Rosa. Your hands are shaking.

25
00:00:56,464 --> 00:00:57,455
Rosa: Cold.

26
00:00:57,575 --> 00:00:59,285
Priya: It's twenty-six degrees in here.

27
00:00:59,605 --> 00:01:06,986
BUS-E: Part seven of ten, The Last Bus. Next:
the toll. Follow for part eight. Mind the gap.

